ImageViewer patch (docs/PLAN.md section 15, D-57, D-93): equal feTurbulence results computed once per render
Library: resvg 0.48.1
Fixes: none (speed: a document may use one noise in several filters, and noise is costly)
Upstream: none yet: to be proposed to linebender/resvg (ours)
Remove when: a resvg release reuses equal feTurbulence results within a render, or this patch no longer applies

The owner's artwork draws two noises six times over its whole canvas. Equal noise over the same pixels
(every argument of turbulence::apply equal) is computed once per render: filter::Cache keeps the four
most recent results, in render::Context. Requires imageviewer-filter-area.patch (its Context).

